# Fault scen_move_on (writer 6): a scenario move whose `on` reads the scenario's own input dom was refused
# LOAD-SCENARIO ("dom of scenario sc is read outside it (by gift)"). L §6.4: a read of an item declared in a scenario file
# is allowed "inside that scenario and the scenarios over it"; the move is the scenario's own. gift moves 5.00 DUK into
# konto on day 15 of each month of 2025: flows(konto, 2025) = 12 x 5.00 = 60.00 DUK.
=== base.tally
model base
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-12-31

source s "s"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2025-01-01..
=== sc.tally
scenario sc over base
  tally 2
  from 2025-01-01

input amt: money DUK

input dom: int

move gift[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

ask q: flows(konto, 2025) in sc

version v
  cite s
  governs 2025-01-01..
  known 2025-01-01
  amt = 5.00 "amt"
  dom = 15 "dom"
=== expect
q: 60.00 DUK
  world: sc
...
